<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Home</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}

body{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
background:linear-gradient(-45deg,#4facfe,#24bd75,#d3915a,#6db334);
background-size:400% 400%;
animation:gradientBG 10s ease infinite;
}

@keyframes gradientBG{
0%{background-position:0% 50%}
50%{background-position:100% 50%}
100%{background-position:0% 50%}
}

.home-card{
text-align:center;
padding:50px;
width:400px;
border-radius:16px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
color:white;
}

.home-card h1{
margin-bottom:15px;
font-size:32px;
}

.home-card p{
margin-bottom:30px;
font-size:16px;
opacity:0.9;
}

button{
padding:12px 25px;
border:none;
border-radius:8px;
background:#fff;
color:#333;
font-size:16px;
font-weight:bold;
cursor:pointer;
transition:0.3s;
}

button:hover{
background:#000;
color:#fff;
transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.session-info{
margin:20px 0 30px 0;
text-align:left;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
padding:15px;
color: rgb(94, 35, 35);
border-radius:10px;
font-size:14px;
line-height:1.6;
}

.session-info h3{
margin-bottom:10px;
font-size:16px;
}

.session-info ol{
padding-left:18px;
}

</style>

</head>
<body>

<div class="home-card">

<h1>Hello, <%= user %> 👋</h1>

<p>Welcome to your dashboard.</p>

<div class="session-info">
    <h3>How Session-Based Authentication Works</h3>
  
    <ol>
      <li>User logs in with valid credentials.</li>
      <li>The server creates a <strong>session</strong> and stores user data on the server.</li>
      <li>A unique <strong>session ID</strong> is sent to the browser as a cookie (<code>connect.sid</code>).</li>
      <li>The browser automatically sends this cookie with every request.</li>
      <li>The server verifies the session ID and retrieves the user session.</li>
      <li>If the session exists, the user is considered authenticated.</li>
      <li>When the user logs out, the server destroys the session.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

<form action="/logout" method="get">
    <button type="submit">Logout</button>
  </form>

</div>

</body>
</html>